              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تزلج — tazallaja — \"to ski; to skate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تزلجنا على الثلج في الشتاء. tazallajnā ʿalā ath-thalj fī ash-shitāʾ. We skied on the snow in winter."
            },
