              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كيس — kīs — \"a plastic bag; a sack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وضعنا الطعام في كيس كبير. waḍaʿnā aṭ-ṭaʿām fī kīs kabīr. We put the food in a big bag."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: أكياس, akyās."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ḥaqība is a bag one carries; kīs is a sack or a plastic bag."
            }
          ]
        },
